-- Showcase Level 3 (design sum-type-showcase): `observe` built in userspace.
-- There is no `observe` keyword here; the Maybe idiom it desugars to is written
-- out directly, with the convention `Just x = right x`, `Nothing = left ()`
-- (observe-partials-umbrella N3).
--
--   observe base pred  ==  let v = base in if pred v then right v else left ()
--
-- The base must be let-bound: it occurs twice, and a probabilistic base spliced
-- in twice would be two independent draws.
main = let v = if Uniform < 0.5 then 1 else 0 in if v == 1 then right v else left ()
